Key for string format of Test Sequence report
-----------------------------------------------------
S - Stim PI
I - Stim PPI
s - Stim Latch
P - Pulse Clock (P is followed by name of the clock being pulsed)
p - Dynamic Pulse Clock (p is followed by name of the clock being pulsed)
C - Stim Clock
Q - Pulse PPI (Q is followed by name of the clock being pulsed)
q - Dynamic Pulse PPI (q is followed by name of the clock being pulsed)
L - LoadOPCGcontrols
l - LoadChannelMasks
u - UseChannelMasks
M - Measure PO
m - Measure Latch
r - Measure Current
c - Channel_Scan
d - Diagnostic_Scan_Unload
F - Force
O - Product MISR Signature
X - Any other events
Z - CompressedInputStream or CompressedOutputStream
W - Wait_osc
A - Load_SR
a - Unload_SR
B - Composite_MISR_Signature


